  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello,\nim asking today about disabling our own hand gestures in the menu.\n\nTheirs a lot of public avatars that I enjoy but some have hand gestures and id rather never use them and accidentally hitting the triggers that will play loud sounds and particles can be rather annoying to the point they aggravate my guest or people around me including myself isn't something I want and sometimes be embarrassing, I'm asking if we can have a option to disable our own hand gestures in the menu to prevent unwanted gestures playing \n\nthanks for reading I hope this option can be considered in the future...",
